  "description": "Provides extensions for ICouchbaseCollection to perform multiple similar operations in parallel. For example, getting 100 documents based on their keys or performing a bulk insert of 100,000 documents. It is optimized to maximize throughput by limiting the degree of parallelization and to returning exceptions separately for each operation.",
